{
  "an3.57:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.57 ",
  "an3.57:0.2": "6. Brāhmaṇavagga ",
  "an3.57:0.3": "Vacchagottasutta ",
  "an3.57:1.1": "Atha kho vacchagotto paribbājako yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "an3.57:1.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho vacchagotto paribbājako bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an3.57:1.3": "“sutaṁ metaṁ, bho gotama, samaṇo gotamo evamāha: ",
  "an3.57:1.4": "‘mayhameva dānaṁ dātabbaṁ, nāññesaṁ dānaṁ dātabbaṁ; ",
  "an3.57:1.5": "mayhameva sāvakānaṁ dānaṁ dātabbaṁ, nāññesaṁ sāvakānaṁ dānaṁ dātabbaṁ; ",
  "an3.57:1.6": "mayhameva dinnaṁ mahapphalaṁ, nāññesaṁ dinnaṁ mahapphalaṁ; ",
  "an3.57:1.7": "mayhameva sāvakānaṁ dinnaṁ mahapphalaṁ, nāññesaṁ sāvakānaṁ dinnaṁ mahapphalan’ti. ",
  "an3.57:1.8": "Ye te, bho gotama, evamāhaṁsu ‘samaṇo gotamo evamāha: ",
  "an3.57:1.9": "“mayhameva dānaṁ dātabbaṁ, nāññesaṁ dānaṁ dātabbaṁ. ",
  "an3.57:1.10": "Mayhameva sāvakānaṁ dānaṁ dātabbaṁ, nāññesaṁ sāvakānaṁ dānaṁ dātabbaṁ. ",
  "an3.57:1.11": "Mayhameva dinnaṁ mahapphalaṁ, nāññesaṁ dinnaṁ mahapphalaṁ. ",
  "an3.57:1.12": "Mayhameva sāvakānaṁ dinnaṁ mahapphalaṁ, nāññesaṁ sāvakānaṁ dinnaṁ mahapphalan”’ti. ",
  "an3.57:1.13": "Kacci te bhoto gotamassa vuttavādino na ca bhavantaṁ gotamaṁ abhūtena abbh�